      "comment": "POSITANO (7) showed good early speed and led throughout to score his maiden two back then finished fourth last start and beaten 6 lengths at this track over 400m (22.90). Back to track where he won his maiden. Better than latest and can atone here. LITTLE SKITTLES (4) was impressive last time, posting an effortless 5 lengths win in taking a Novice race in 22.50 and a new Best time this course and distance. This tougher but looks a leading chance again. FROTHING (1) broke from a low draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only one length (22.06) behind Rippin' Rasputin at Cannington. Ready to find winning form. TOMMY BELL (2) has top-three aspirations after placing here over this journey last time.",
